  <reporting-org ref="GB-GOV-1" type="10">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UK - Foreign, Commonwealth Development Office (FCDO)</narrative>
  </reporting-org>
  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Technical Assistance support to the Ministry of Finance, President&apos;s Office Regional Administration &amp; Local Government.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Part of FCDO Official Development Assistance (ODA) portfolio involves the UK Government to work with the Government of Tanzania through financial aid as part of contribution to development programmes. It is therefore important to understand the fiduciary risk environment in across the central and local Government systems to enable FCDO to analyse the portfolio risk, support its operational decisions and strengthen programme management to mitigate risks.

In addition, FCDO&#x2019;s support aims to strengthen public financial management and governance systems. This includes improving local government revenue generation frameworks, enhancing service delivery mechanisms, and promoting more transparent, accountable, and inclusive governance at all levels of government.</narrative>
  </description>
